ls, top-of-book imbalance I was on the opposite side (or nearly flat), so a strict same-side I>0 / I<0 filter could never agree. Lowered the agreement floor from 0 to −0.25 / +0.25 and required 2 agreeing snapshots instead of 3. That would have allowed 2 of T’s 3 live trades (the UP fill at I=−0.25 would still be blocked). Expected rate approaches T’s when the book is not strongly opposed (T’s 18-day backtest is ~10 trades/day / +$115 at $5; live T has been quieter)."}],"coinbase_lag":{"reachable":true,"samples":900,"last_price":57005.39,"last_diff_bp":5.283,"mean_abs_bp":8.5579},"btc_minutes":{"as_of":"7:40:06 PM PT","source":"BRTI","last":57003.89,"series":[{"ts":1795228860,"t":"6:41 PM","c":58547.51,"d":-25.01,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795228920,"t":"6:42 PM","c":58497.89,"d":-49.62,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795228980,"t":"6:43 PM","c":58541.52,"d":43.63,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229040,"t":"6:44 PM","c":58526.41,"d":-15.11,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229100,"t":"6:45 PM","c":58516.15,"d":-10.26,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229160,"t":"6:46 PM","c":58604.69,"d":88.54,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229220,"t":"6:47 PM","c":58520.17,"d":-84.52,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229280,"t":"6:48 PM","c":58554.45,"d":34.28,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229340,"t":"6:49 PM","c":58558.66,"d":4.21,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229400,"t":"6:50 PM","c":58545.29,"d":-13.37,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229460,"t":"6:51 PM","c":58546.62,"d":1.33,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229520,"t":"6:52 PM","c":58567.96,"d":21.34,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229580,"t":"6:53 PM","c":58536.26,"d":-31.7,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229640,"t":"6:54 PM","c":58579.55,"d":43.29,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229700,"t":"6:55 PM","c":58536.99,"d":-42.56,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229760,"t":"6:56 PM","c":58507.46,"d":-29.53,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229820,"t":"6:57 PM","c":58512.19,"d":4.73,"dir":"up"},{"ts":1795229880,"t":"6:58 PM","c":58509.97,"d":-2.22,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795229940,"t":"6:59 PM","c":58496.43,"d":-13.54,"dir":"down"},{"ts":1795230000,"t":"7:00 PM","c":58404.89,"d":-9